Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have you seen my checkbook？- Yeah。It's downstairs in the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darling，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna take the dog for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice office.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry to disturb you at this time of night…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we have a little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your boss owes me money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,A lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm here to collect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just the accountant。I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't need to know anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,except the combination to the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do know the combination，yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect。Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is 310-555-0199。Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，my friend。It's Malankov.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came to your office to collect my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a disappointment to see it's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I am leaving you something here in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,My best to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,How old？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter how old they are，my friend，they will always be our baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ain't that true？Come on，big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whoa！- Happy birthday！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My birthday's not even for three days。- You're always saying I'm so predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanted to shake things up a bit，make it a little less predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Champagne glasses？- You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would I have champagne glasses？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or a giant stuffed panda？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Inappropriate？- Well，I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- not if I was 7。- I can return it…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,or you can hang on to it until you have a 7-year-old of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，baby。Babe？- Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，look who's here。- Mr。Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Jimy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How are you？- Good。You？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know。Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，if you guys are having a father- daughter moment，I can really…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。I just dropped by。I thought I'd do something unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim's always pointing out how predictable I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's funny coming from her。You wanna talk about predictable？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not predictable！- Oh，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every single day she goes to the same exact store，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,right off campus，every morning before class…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- and gets the same peach yogurt drink。- Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The fourth one from the back。Not the fifth one，not the third one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The fourth one will stay cold，but not too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That way，when she's drinking it，as a snack in between classes…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's still cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。I would do exactly the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，the OCD gene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's with the bubbly？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pre-birthday celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:08:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't mind，I just think it's a little early to pop open a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll put it in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa。A panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll leave you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have to take it。Now I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you should feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll exchange it for something more predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Love you。- Take it easy，Jimy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is something wrong？- Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure，babe？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop。Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just need a second，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might want to buckle up，Phillip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did it go？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.32,0:09:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great。Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Couldn't have gone better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The panda was not a hit，I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful what you say。He's sitting right next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did she grow up，Lenore？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。It goes so fast。All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just going home。Make a little dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- If you'd like to join us。- 「Us」？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me and the panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll… take a rain check on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that's okay with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the panda？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's fine by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep it to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You changed your mind！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。You left the door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not intruding？- No，of course you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just preparing dinner。Drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You look stressed。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've tried everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Therapy。Counseling。Together，separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wants it to work。He really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know I'm hurting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just don't feel anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate that。I hate not feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate going through the motions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only thing I feel is trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have the worst taste in men！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know what I fantasize about？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And right after…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,the guilt comes roaring in and I feel like such a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does it make me a bad person…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,being married to one man，fantasizing about another？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Confused maybe。Bad？No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you are，Lennie，you're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry。- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's me that should be apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't want to。Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,But until you and Stuart clear up your situation…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it would do more harm than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,For all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you have to be so damn honorable？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Believe me，right now，I wish I weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna go。- Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going out of town in a couple of days for a month on a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you ever feel you need to go someplace just to be by yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I put on six pounds of muscle。- Oh，you guys are giving me a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's not helping your stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were plus two on the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You？Me？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did the rest of you get on the green？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,But seriously，it's money。It would be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。I can't go，Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a four-man job。We can't do it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。But a couple of things have come up…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'm not comfortable being away for a month right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Man，you gotta let this go。- You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lenore's a grown woman。She can take care of herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not her husband any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,But she is my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you better talk to somebody about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,A shrink，maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would I go to a shrink when I got you guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can somebody drop the flag stick？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Kim。What's up？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You want me to take it out？- If you wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。When？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。The big moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is an unexpected treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I… need some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess it's not something I was really planning on…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,or even thought about，ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.16,0:14:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，I just wanted your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm so sorry。Just stop this。- Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poor lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is going to be serious trouble in a few years。You mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was it you wanted to ask？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,A puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A puppy？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was thinking about getting a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,From where？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,My friend found one behind her building…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we were trying to find it a home…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,we put it on Facebook，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,but nobody claimed it yet，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna know what I think？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，it's a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a lot of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,With your lifestyle the way it is at the moment，with college.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,With a puppy you have to be there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,all the time and feed it，walk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's no different than having a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you had a chance to look at the menus？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet，Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,What will I have？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stuart。- Hey，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I talk to you inside？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，sure。I was just making some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Milk？Sugar？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Both，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Milk，cold or hot？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hot，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，how's business？- Oh，you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some days good，some days great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,One sugar or two？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here we go。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to bother you this late…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I thought it was more，respectful…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,to say what I have to say to you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,face-to-face，man-to-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,So to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know that Lenore has…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's spoken to you about the problems that we've been having.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a good guy，Bryan。I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a respectful guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，listen，I'm not accusing you of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Lenore and I… if our marriage is gonna work…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,that can't happen with you in between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，Stuart…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,there's nothing between Lenore and I，other than we share Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't say there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obviously…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,you share a daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,and… you've tried to be the best father that you can，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,under the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,And… part of that means the two of you talking and staying in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I still want you to stop seeing my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until we sort things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does she know you're here？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if she does，or if she doesn't。That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to stop seeing my wife。Can you do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta go to Vegas tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some business meeting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really don't want to be worrying about…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- you know。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Need to see you。Urgent。Bagels.」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four bagels and some cream cheese，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Be careful。They're really hot。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.72,0:19:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus，God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie？Wake up！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lennie！- Freeze！Don't move！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step away from the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get your hands up！- Sir，back away，now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your hands up，now！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You gotta listen to me。- On the floor，now！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Down on the floor！- Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Step away from the knife！- On your knees。Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your hands up！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hands up！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hands up！Higher！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.84,0:20:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Moving in！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's there！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop your weapon！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he's heading west！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's heading north。22nd street。Back alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Suspect in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go inside。I'm heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Police！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Door's sealed！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Door is sealed。Shit！- I just saw him inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear！Moving in！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.52,0:23:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see him anywhere？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,He disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,God damn it。He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is 103。Suspect is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.67,0:23:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ The sun is old on water ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Yearling flakes keep whirling by ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Carry me，me awry ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.59,0:24:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Collapsing breaths discover ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Turning hope，new-boarded highs ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Receding howls dew the skies ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.88,0:24:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，it's Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.76,0:24:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.36,0:24:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm at Mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looking for my yellow sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.12,0:24:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you alone？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.88,0:24:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart is in Vegas。Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.80,0:24:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.40,0:24:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，what's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:25:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something terrible has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.40,0:25:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I want you to hear it from me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.84,0:25:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.32,0:25:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone murdered her…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,in my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks like I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.72,0:25:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know why。I don't know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.52,0:25:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm going to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen carefully，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.40,0:25:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says，don't trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.72,0:25:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- You hear？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll find a way to contact you。- But Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.08,0:25:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad？- I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.76,0:25:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.10,0:25:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，you need to check this out，alright？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sergeant Dotzler，suspect's name is Bryan Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- His？- His.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.84,0:26:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not his.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The officers arrived on the scene because…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.80,0:26:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anonymous call came in，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.32,0:26:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,reported a woman screaming…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.72,0:26:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「He's killing me。He's killing me.」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.72,0:26:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her name is Lenore St。John.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,We sent a car to her address。It was listed on her license.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.36,0:26:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her daughter was there，but her husband was in Las Vegas on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.88,0:26:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's… taking the first flight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.16,0:26:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Any witnesses？- We're canvassing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call came from an unlisted number.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're checking out the cells as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.64,0:26:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Download both of the phones，correlate the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.36,0:26:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to know when these two people…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.64,0:27:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,spoke，texted，emailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.32,0:27:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every form of communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.36,0:27:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dates，times…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,duration of calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.84,0:27:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's bag this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.76,0:27:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective，bag that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.88,0:27:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.28,0:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，this is still a very active crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.16,0:27:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Investigators have been here on the scene
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.88,0:27:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,all morning，but so far…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,police have not told us what happened inside the apartment…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.12,0:27:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,where earlier this morning… a woman's body was discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.88,0:27:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan Mills is the owner of the apartment…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.20,0:27:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the ex-husband of the deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who's this？- It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.64,0:27:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't do it，Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.20,0:27:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obviously，you didn't do it。Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going down the rabbit hole。The code still the same？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.48,0:28:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。It's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.88,0:28:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll be in touch。- Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.08,0:28:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，this is the area we lost him，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.88,0:28:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guy vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.44,0:28:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the gun that he took… off one of our officers，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.20,0:28:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He had a gun，and he didn't fire at you？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.16,0:28:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the helicopters…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.72,0:28:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,saw nothing？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.20,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Choppers didn't see anything，sir。No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.44,0:28:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know he's good…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.60,0:28:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,but…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.20,0:28:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,vanishing into thin air？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's move the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.72,0:30:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know why your wife went to visit Mr。Mills？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.08,0:30:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their relationship was mostly centered around their daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.28,0:30:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.84,0:30:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,he wanted more than friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I asked her to speak to him…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.32,0:30:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,and tell him that he should stop bothering her about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.52,0:30:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you think that's what she was doing over there？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.88,0:30:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.12,0:30:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart，why are they going through all of Mom's stuff？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.32,0:30:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.28,0:30:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss St。John，Frank Dotzler.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.48,0:30:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mills。My name is Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.50,0:31:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.50,0:31:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're just looking around to see if we can find something to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.68,0:31:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.40,0:31:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would just really like
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.04,0:31:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,them out of her bedroom for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.16,0:31:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garcia，let's vacate the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.20,0:31:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody out of the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.56,0:31:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.24,0:31:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I could just have a few minutes of your time。Ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.24,0:31:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why aren't you out there trying to find out who did this…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.08,0:31:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,instead of just standing around，going through our home？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have people out there looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,But in order for me to get a full picture…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to ask questions of him。I have to ask questions of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.40,0:31:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mom went to see my dad。I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.28,0:31:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably to talk about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.64,0:31:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，there's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,He didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.16,0:31:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,He just didn't。He didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.16,0:31:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no way on earth he would lay a hand on her。Just，don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.76,0:32:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.84,0:32:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.64,0:32:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's mine。That's not even hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.40,0:32:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.76,0:33:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.56,0:33:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.76,0:33:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.52,0:33:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,If something comes to mind，anything at all…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.88,0:33:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might not be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.28,0:33:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what happened in Paris
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.84,0:33:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Istanbul a couple years ago where Bryan saved his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.20,0:33:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。You think that's connected to this？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.92,0:33:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never really wanted to know all the details…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.88,0:33:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,but a lot of people ended up dead and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.44,0:33:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what you're telling me is…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.12,0:33:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm dealing with a very dangerous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.20,0:33:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.64,0:33:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Bryan's not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.80,0:33:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The world he lives in is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.92,0:34:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He loves his family…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,but he has a lot of enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.00,0:34:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring him into Room Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.64,0:34:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garcia will… get you back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.64,0:34:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.54,0:36:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,This guy's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.48,0:36:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,At 21，he's in the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.84,0:36:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,At 23，he joins Special Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.48,0:36:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.68,0:36:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No service record.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.52,0:36:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No discharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.76,0:36:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like spy shit to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.60,0:36:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until we have another suspect，he's our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.12,0:36:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,So here's our best way of finding him。His daughter with the deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.40,0:36:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her husband says that he's really close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.16,0:36:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Devoted to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.24,0:36:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,So let's keep a close watch on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.56,0:36:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where she goes，who she calls，who she talks to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.20,0:36:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's not screw this up，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.84,0:36:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，this is gonna be our best shot at finding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.52,0:36:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do we have the deceased's car？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.20,0:36:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that just came in。They have his，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Garcia，Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.76,0:36:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's do a full sweep of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.84,0:36:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,GPS downloaded，see where he went and when.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.84,0:36:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,See if they correlate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.72,0:36:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,See if we can find out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.52,0:37:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just came in，his and hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.32,0:37:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.40,0:37:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.76,0:37:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what's this about？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.16,0:37:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some guy offed his ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.68,0:37:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allegedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.56,0:37:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Allegedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.72,0:37:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He didn't do her in the car，did he？- No，in his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.68,0:37:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。I hate going in those after.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.76,0:38:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blood。Pieces of flesh and shit。It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.60,0:38:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which GPS you want done first？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.44,0:38:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,His，then hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.44,0:38:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.64,0:38:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell were you doing all the way out there，Lenore？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.36,0:38:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.12,0:38:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector Mallory，LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.44,0:38:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're following up on a missing persons investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.36,0:38:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you'd seen this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.32,0:38:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was here about 10 p.m。last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.20,0:39:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was here then.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.64,0:39:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't see her。I didn't see hardly nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.40,0:39:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not exactly a bustling destination，if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.56,0:39:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Sally.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.92,0:39:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.12,0:39:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Duty calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.64,0:39:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amanda？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.28,0:39:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.92,0:39:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector Mallory，LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.24,0:39:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are these security cameras operative or are they just there for show？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.64,0:39:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，they work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.92,0:39:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.88,0:39:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have the tape from yesterday？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.52,0:39:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I wasn't here。The other guy was.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.24,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if someone was here，it will be on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.40,0:39:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just push that button for the playback.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.48,0:39:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna stay here while you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.80,0:40:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have problems with this system？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.64,0:40:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Breaks down sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.92,0:40:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,They keep saying they're gonna replace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.28,0:40:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.88,0:40:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you seen this woman？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.76,0:40:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fellas should get more coordinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coordinated？What do you mean？Like，color-coordinated？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.96,0:40:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，like，one of your guys was just in here asking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.12,0:40:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- One of our guys？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.60,0:40:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Him？- Yeah。Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.68,0:40:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Took off to the gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.44,0:41:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.88,0:41:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Mills？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.72,0:41:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.08,0:41:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Step out，buddy。- Get out of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.92,0:41:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.44,0:41:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop what you're doing，Mr。Mills！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.12,0:41:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step away from the desk！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.64,0:41:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back away from the desk，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.84,0:41:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step away from that desk，or I'll shoot you！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.40,0:41:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll shoot。- Step away from the God damn desk，now！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.64,0:41:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step away one step from the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.76,0:41:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keep your hands where we can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.00,0:41:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay perfectly still.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.92,0:42:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.16,0:42:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything you say can and will be used against you in a court of law.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.16,0:42:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have the right to an attorney…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.84,0:42:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't have one present during questioning…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.40,0:42:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brooks。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.04,0:43:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garcia and Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.32,0:43:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,They got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.84,0:43:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Garcia。- Yeah，just picked him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.68,0:43:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy-peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.96,0:43:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he's a pro like you said…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.68,0:43:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,he wasn't on his game today.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.28,0:43:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's playing you！- What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.16,0:43:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.48,0:43:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's back in Phillips' car。Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.80,0:43:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop the cars！- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.04,0:43:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop the cars！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.20,0:43:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.48,0:43:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Phillips。- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.56,0:43:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our boss has got a hair up his ass about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.20,0:43:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keep an eye on this guy，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.96,0:43:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.32,0:43:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They think we're idiots。- It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.04,0:43:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He acts like I've never done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.76,0:43:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's just being Dotzler.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.48,0:43:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what it is？He's a control freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.16,0:43:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he's not doing it himself，he's not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.64,0:44:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep driving！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.76,0:44:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Phillips！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.88,0:44:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.96,0:45:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，my God！- You see that？What the hell is he doing！？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.84,0:45:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull it over！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.12,0:46:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back it up！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.00,0:46:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of the car！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.52,0:46:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drive！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.88,0:46:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.20,0:46:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，move.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.80,0:46:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.24,0:46:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.48,0:46:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is gonna end bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.72,0:46:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be such a pessimist.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.64,0:46:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Connecting to LAPD protected files.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.48,0:47:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,All units，code 10-29
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.68,0:47:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,on a police car number 706.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.92,0:47:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Number 706.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.16,0:47:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Suspect in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.52,0:47:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，here！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.44,0:48:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send some backup，now！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dotzler.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.00,0:49:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,By now，I'm sure you know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.00,0:49:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I'm capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.84,0:49:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am beginning to.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.52,0:49:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me ask you something，just so I'm clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.60,0:49:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,CIA operative？Division 6？Division 7？What？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.08,0:49:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,All you have to know is I'm innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.72,0:49:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me two days，I can prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.44,0:49:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can find out who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.44,0:49:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may very well be innocent，Mr。Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that's the court's job to decide，it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.32,0:49:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,My job…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.52,0:49:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,is to bring you in and let the law take its course，that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.00,0:49:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.96,0:50:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a GPS on the phone。He's heading north.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.04,0:50:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me to send units？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.96,0:50:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't bother。He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.28,0:50:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's a dead end。- Wait，wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.32,0:50:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why does he want us to have this？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.64,0:50:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He fucked up。- This guy doesn't fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.48,0:50:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wants us to watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.12,0:50:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.60,0:50:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.60,0:50:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is she waiting for？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.00,0:50:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are these guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.84,0:50:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Holy shit！- Who are these guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.12,0:50:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me our tech guy。I need some magic done on a security tape。Now。Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.36,0:51:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.00,0:51:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pileup on the 710 North.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.20,0:51:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Massive clusterfuck of police vehicles 15 miles headed south.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.32,0:51:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.52,0:51:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，thanks，Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.80,0:51:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to tell me what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.40,0:51:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lenore sent me a text.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.16,0:51:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Asked to come over to my place for bagels.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.24,0:51:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got the bagels.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.48,0:51:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I came back，I found her car out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.04,0:51:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，She was in my bed with her throat slashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.20,0:51:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.40,0:51:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What else？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.68,0:51:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found a location on her car's GPS
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.84,0:51:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,from the night before.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.24,0:51:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was out at this gas station in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.36,0:51:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw it on a security camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.28,0:51:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was snatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.68,0:52:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want us to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.28,0:52:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I downloaded all her phone records from the police files。And mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.72,0:52:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe there's something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.36,0:52:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need analysis of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.88,0:52:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her hair。Might turn up something，might turn up nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.04,0:52:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything else？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.92,0:52:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to go to the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.56,0:52:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Bible constantly tells us…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.88,0:52:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,that there will be difficult times in life…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.96,0:52:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,when we feel like we are walking…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.88,0:52:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,through a dark，dangerous valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.72,0:52:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Valley of the shadow of death。- Are you OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.08,0:52:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what the word of God does make very clear…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.56,0:52:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,is that，as we move through such times…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.88,0:52:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,「the Lord is my shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.56,0:52:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「He maketh me to lie down in green pastures.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.44,0:52:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「He leadeth me beside still waters.」
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.24,0:52:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the name of the Father…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.80,0:52:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,and of the Son…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.60,0:52:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,and of the Holy Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:52:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you holding up？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.12,0:53:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.84,0:53:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get me sound on that。Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.44,0:53:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.48,0:53:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there's anything we can do…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.44,0:53:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.80,0:53:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.12,0:53:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know that，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.28,0:53:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，baby。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.48,0:53:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.68,0:53:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear that？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.20,0:53:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear that click？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.44,0:53:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We're getting some interference somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.68,0:53:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,There it goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.88,0:53:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.88,0:53:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.36,0:53:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're jamming our signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.96,0:53:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.56,0:53:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so，so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.00,0:53:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.56,0:53:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.32,0:53:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stick to your schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.20,0:53:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your very predictable schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.36,0:54:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me to put a tail on them？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.92,0:54:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's a waste of time。It'd be a waste of our money.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.60,0:54:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,These guys could lose a tail
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.96,0:54:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,if it was attached to a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.76,0:54:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.08,0:54:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cut the feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.28,0:55:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart，why are there still…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.40,0:55:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are there still cops camped outside？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.04,0:55:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's standard operating procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.56,0:55:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,They think my dad's going to show up here？Are they stupid or something？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.64,0:55:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what they think.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.00,0:55:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector Dotzler asked if we minded and I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.96,0:55:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should have asked me。I mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.44,0:55:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.80,0:55:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who's he？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.60,0:55:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we um… We need protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.76,0:55:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，honey，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.92,0:55:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it's hard on you，but it's hard on me，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.40,0:55:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I didn't realize it was a competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.00,0:55:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not a competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.76,0:55:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，don't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.16,0:55:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not responsible for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.00,0:56:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't hate you，Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.44,0:56:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,But for the last two years…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.60,0:56:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,every time I looked into my mom's eyes…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.04,0:56:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,the only thing I saw was hurt and sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.60,0:56:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,And for that…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.04,0:56:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do hold you responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.28,0:56:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are you going？- School.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.12,0:56:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I'm allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:56:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got you，baby。I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.68,0:57:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why are you following me？- It's for your own protection，miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.60,0:57:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Protection？From who？My father？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.84,0:57:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really think my father would hurt me？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mother probably didn't think so either.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.20,0:57:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.04,0:57:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.40,0:58:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.60,0:58:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's on campus。You want me to follow？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.44,0:58:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is the bug active？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.08,0:58:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,and listen。If he shows up，we'll hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.56,0:58:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What else？- She went into this convenience store，
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.96,0:58:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,chugged down a drink of some kind right from the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.60,0:58:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.96,0:58:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep me informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.72,0:59:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,As you might remember，last week we discussed disassociations…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.88,0:59:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,and interactions between dorsal and ventral streams… in object recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.68,0:59:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，a Dominant Hypothesis…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.04,0:59:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,is that the dorsal stream is supporting motor interactions with objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.36,0:59:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,While ventral stream structures extract visual information…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.32,0:59:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,about the object that is independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.72,0:59:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a little nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.88,0:59:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you mind taking notes for me？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.48,0:59:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，sure。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.04,0:59:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，in other words，object knowledge is represented in the ventral stream…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.84,0:59:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。I wonder if you could… help me out with something？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.52,0:59:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sure。- There was a young woman in here…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.32,0:59:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- about an hour ago？- Oh，yeah。Poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.32,0:59:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Does she come here often？- Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.92,1:00:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She bought what？- Same thing，a peach yogurt drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.00,1:00:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,But today，she drank it all right there from the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.92,1:00:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must have been thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.52,1:00:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got anything？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.60,1:00:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，she went to school。Got nauseous in class.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.96,1:00:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now she's on her way to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.56,1:00:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call for back-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.76,1:00:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.56,1:01:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，Kim。Drink this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.84,1:01:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I put something in the yogurt to make you nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.08,1:01:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,This will take it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.48,1:01:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.08,1:01:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.20,1:01:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Kim。Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.36,1:01:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.12,1:01:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy。I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.64,1:01:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.28,1:01:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.48,1:01:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.72,1:01:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.92,1:02:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.64,1:02:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have low blood sugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.20,1:02:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.88,1:02:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eat this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.64,1:02:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.00,1:02:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get through this first and then…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.24,1:02:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,we'll figure out what's best for…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.48,1:02:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you have to do is act natural.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.64,1:02:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,This cop is really smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.48,1:02:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything out of the usual…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.00,1:02:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,he'll become suspicious。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.68,1:02:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.52,1:02:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.20,1:02:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.20,1:03:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in the science building。East wing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.72,1:03:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's in the bathroom。- Don't move。Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.20,1:03:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you staying？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.92,1:03:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm still at Mom's.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.08,1:03:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I started packing her stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.44,1:03:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,It just… It doesn't feel real.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.04,1:03:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.88,1:03:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.20,1:03:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，there's…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.40,1:03:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart's been acting really weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.08,1:03:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must be scared about something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.92,1:03:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,He hired bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.04,1:03:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.24,1:03:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was so much fun。But you know what？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.88,1:03:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He was such a jerk。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.88,1:03:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,He made me pay for my own drink at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.60,1:03:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did！I was wearing something more skimpy than this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.44,1:03:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- More skimpy than that？- I don't know what was happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.72,1:03:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe he's blind。I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.24,1:03:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.56,1:04:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He is such a jerk。- I'm not gonna do it again，though.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.00,1:04:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's cool，I've seen him。I completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.60,1:04:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's hot，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.08,1:04:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go，go，go！- I'm going！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.60,1:04:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.68,1:04:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.28,1:04:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.12,1:04:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perv！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.96,1:04:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He just left.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.60,1:04:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's in the can.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.12,1:04:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.32,1:04:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seal all the areas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.52,1:04:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.32,1:05:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.84,1:05:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down the south corridor！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.16,1:05:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.16,1:05:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.56,1:05:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.68,1:05:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just move！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.92,1:05:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way！Move，move！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.72,1:06:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you think you're helping him…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.12,1:06:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.88,1:06:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.04,1:06:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless we get him to come in…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.72,1:06:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't start trying to make sense of what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.48,1:06:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone killed my mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.88,1:06:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.60,1:06:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was not my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.40,1:06:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without hearing his side of the story，they can't know that，can they？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.12,1:06:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.48,1:06:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there anything else？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.92,1:06:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know we can arrest you for obstructing an ongoing investigation？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.76,1:06:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arrest me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.08,1:06:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rather not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.96,1:06:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then，if you're not going to，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.96,1:06:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,can I go home？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.68,1:06:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.08,1:07:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.12,1:07:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Interesting family.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.96,1:07:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.60,1:07:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,we will take care of this。Do as we planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.96,1:07:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.32,1:07:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are we going，boss？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.04,1:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Malibu house.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.12,1:09:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，let's go get drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.36,1:10:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.56,1:10:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need a ride。Mind if I drive？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.12,1:10:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.64,1:10:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's your name？- Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.68,1:10:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Bryan。You have kids，Mike？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.64,1:10:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，two.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.52,1:10:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How old？- Owen is three，and Tori is seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.80,1:10:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great age.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.84,1:10:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,A piece of advice。Don't miss a day of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.36,1:10:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before you know it，they'll be having kids of their own.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.84,1:10:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Know what I mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.80,1:11:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.52,1:11:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，if you stand in a field with a book of matches…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.80,1:11:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,you can have hundreds of rabbits in seconds like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.56,1:11:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know how？- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.36,1:11:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in，all rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.20,1:11:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in，all rabbits。You like this？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.56,1:13:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who hired you？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.88,1:14:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you working for？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.48,1:14:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your accent is shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.00,1:14:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you working for？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.96,1:14:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.92,1:14:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scumbag！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.20,1:14:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boss？They're at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.48,1:14:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let them in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.76,1:14:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and take a stroll.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.92,1:14:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need a little privacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.60,1:15:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Many？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.80,1:15:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Many？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.72,1:15:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.36,1:15:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.76,1:16:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of this is making sense to me，Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.72,1:16:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was hoping you could help me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.76,1:16:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.08,1:16:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Survive the crash？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.12,1:16:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Russians who were following me when I was following you…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.04,1:16:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,do they work for you，Stuart？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.36,1:16:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.68,1:16:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.88,1:16:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only thing I know is that you were fucking my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.44,1:16:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know that she's dead！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.60,1:16:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.88,1:16:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.08,1:16:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.64,1:16:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear。I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.00,1:16:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- If I believed that，we wouldn't be here。- No！No！No！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.12,1:16:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malankov！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.52,1:16:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.92,1:16:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malankov.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.36,1:16:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oleg Malankov.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.80,1:16:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is Oleg Malankov？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.04,1:17:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I owe him money.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.60,1:17:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.16,1:17:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll never give up。It's only a game for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.80,1:17:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I lost everything。He said he'd kill my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.60,1:17:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell this to the police？You let them think it was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.44,1:17:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was angry with you。God damn it，you promised！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.04,1:17:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You promised to stop seeing her！- So what do you think happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.56,1:17:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,She came over to my place。This Malankov followed her there？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.96,1:17:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you weren't seeing her behind my back…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.36,1:17:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,she wouldn't have been there in the first place，would she？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.32,1:17:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,They would have killed her someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.12,1:17:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,So why are they coming after me？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.52,1:17:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I told them who you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.84,1:17:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That you would find them and kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.80,1:17:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,How convenient would that be for you？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.16,1:17:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I kill them，your debt is cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.08,1:17:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.00,1:17:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I loved her。You gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.32,1:17:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I loved her！I loved her！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.64,1:17:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's what you're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.48,1:17:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna go to the police and tell them everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.04,1:17:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.40,1:17:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't。He's crazy。You don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.84,1:17:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can do whatever the hell you want。Either way…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.20,1:17:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.00,1:18:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.32,1:18:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,They kill you，they don't get paid.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.60,1:18:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not the one they're gonna come after next.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.88,1:18:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.36,1:18:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.36,1:18:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I get your keys，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.40,1:18:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know what you're getting yourself into，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.24,1:18:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。As a matter of fact，I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.64,1:18:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could I get your keys and your phone，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.20,1:18:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mind putting your hands on the steering wheel？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.44,1:18:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or what？What are you gonna do？Shoot me？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.04,1:18:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Left or right？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.12,1:18:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go ahead，put the cuffs on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.96,1:19:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.60,1:19:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.64,1:19:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.04,1:19:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.56,1:19:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're keeping you safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.44,1:19:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.56,1:19:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Kim。We're gonna get in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.40,1:19:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.60,1:20:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.60,1:20:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bernard Harris.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.68,1:20:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a trained sniper.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.20,1:20:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Left the army at 24.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.64,1:20:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing，nothing after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.28,1:20:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing until he registers as one of three founders
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.60,1:20:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,of something called Private Securities International.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.52,1:20:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other two being，Casey Mark，
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.68,1:20:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Navy Seal，eight years' service.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.40,1:20:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Explosives expert.」 It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.72,1:20:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Next time we hear from him，he's 45
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.12,1:20:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Senior Vice President
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.04,1:20:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,of Private Securities International.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.76,1:20:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam Grossman，communications expert，
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.12,1:20:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,a wizard，
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.28,1:20:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he's the COO of Private Securities International.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.52,1:21:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，our primary person of interest…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.08,1:21:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan Mills.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.08,1:21:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,is listed as an 「employee」 of Private…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.84,1:21:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get the picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.32,1:21:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are very serious people.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.64,1:21:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't bring your A-game，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.16,1:21:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,they're gonna run around you，through you，under you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.72,1:21:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need it to stop right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.32,1:21:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's one more thing。This.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.36,1:21:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Russian，he killed himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.32,1:21:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably because he didn't wanna give up the information
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.32,1:21:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,that Mills was asking him for.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.08,1:21:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because obviously，he's not trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.84,1:21:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obviously，he's not trying to kill anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.64,1:21:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's only trying to get information.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.48,1:21:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's only trying to figure this out，just like we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.76,1:21:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except for the fact that he is a step ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.12,1:22:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to know the relationship between the Russians
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.72,1:22:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the wife's murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.04,1:22:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of these four people，they know something about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.72,1:22:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,They know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.72,1:22:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you guys to find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.00,1:22:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to bring them in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.08,1:22:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Anything yet？- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.60,1:22:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing came up from the samples you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.12,1:22:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,But this is gonna take a while to sort through.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.68,1:22:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan，there's a shitload of data here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.80,1:22:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.60,1:22:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I downloaded the police computers.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.80,1:22:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- For what？- The first thing they're gonna look at are the phone records to
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.82,1:22:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,see if there are any clues.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.44,1:22:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mine and Lenore's.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.68,1:22:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's it gonna tell you，that you and Lenore spoke to each other？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.52,1:22:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？Don't worry about it。We're almost done here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.48,1:22:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what's the plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.04,1:22:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The plan is to make sure my daughter is safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.12,1:22:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the only way to do that，so it seems…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.28,1:22:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,is to eliminate the thing that will make her unsafe.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.92,1:22:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malankov.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.28,1:23:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good one，Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.68,1:23:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.32,1:23:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you're gonna help，all right。Like bait helps to catch a shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.52,1:23:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.88,1:23:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Start talking about Malankov.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.64,1:23:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to know every detail.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.24,1:23:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who he is，what he does，where he lives…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.36,1:23:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,where he works.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.32,1:23:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oleg Malankov.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.64,1:23:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's as tough as they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.00,1:23:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He served in the Russian Army
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.56,1:23:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,when they invaded Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.96,1:23:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was Spetsnaz.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.88,1:23:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like our Navy SEALS.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.12,1:23:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,After the collapse of the Soviet Union，
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.04,1:23:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,when everyone was grabbing what they could…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.80,1:23:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,there was a real demand for men with his kind of skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.80,1:23:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,He became one of the grabbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.72,1:23:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I met him when I was doing a deal involving heavy machinery.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.12,1:23:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since then，we did business on a number of different occasions.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.12,1:23:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some deals worked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.04,1:24:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.00,1:24:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last one didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.52,1:24:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.48,1:24:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mom is dead because of one of your shitty business deals？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.60,1:24:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.76,1:24:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，that's not what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.68,1:24:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.68,1:24:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.36,1:24:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.64,1:24:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.00,1:24:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.24,1:24:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because you're gonna set him up for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.08,1:24:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make the call。Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.56,1:24:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,On speaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.24,1:24:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pow.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.96,1:25:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart。I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.80,1:25:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have your money.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.96,1:25:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have it？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.28,1:25:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.80,1:25:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can I trust you？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.16,1:25:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.12,1:25:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where do you want me to bring it？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.64,1:25:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meet me at the building downtown.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.12,1:25:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,In one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.36,1:25:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure，one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.68,1:25:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scumbag！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.52,1:25:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me how his security works.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.88,1:25:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malankov works out of his penthouse apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.28,1:25:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has a private elevator with two bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.64,1:25:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malankov is coming。Send the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.48,1:25:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The elevator is controlled by security upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.28,1:25:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once they see who's inside the elevator and give the okay…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.68,1:25:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,they will send the elevator up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.64,1:25:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Outside the elevator，upstairs…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.80,1:25:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,is a security station and three more bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.96,1:25:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two sets of doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.64,1:25:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Through the second set of doors is Malankov's private apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.52,1:26:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you help me out，here？I got an address but I don't have a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.84,1:26:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I got a back full of perishables。- Go to the first floor and ask for the desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.00,1:26:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- First floor。Thank you so much。- You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.44,1:26:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.56,1:26:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here to see Oleg Malankov.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.24,1:26:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，sir，have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.72,1:26:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.56,1:26:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.80,1:27:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Dotzler.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.88,1:27:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Answer it。Act normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.28,1:27:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't try anything smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.44,1:27:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- Mr。St。John？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.08,1:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank Dotzler.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.40,1:27:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.64,1:27:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in a business meeting。Is there anything wrong？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.32,1:27:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan Mills removed your stepdaughter from your home.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.64,1:27:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm there right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.92,1:27:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。That's…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.60,1:27:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When are you coming home？- I'm leaving immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.92,1:27:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It should take me about an hour to get there from where I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.28,1:27:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where exactly is that？- Malibu.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.76,1:27:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，Inspector，I don't think he means her any harm.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.28,1:27:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。St。John，this man is the prime suspect in the murder of your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.12,1:27:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,His associates held guns on my men
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.48,1:27:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the front of your home.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.60,1:27:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned，he is dangerous and has to be taken into custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.44,1:27:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，if you'd like，I can send a car for you，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.76,1:27:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I need you somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.16,1:27:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.64,1:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm leaving right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.60,1:28:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.04,1:28:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get me a location on St。John's phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.64,1:28:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,As soon as he finds out you're not in Malibu，
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.28,1:28:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,he'll be headed right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.52,1:28:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd say we have
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.08,1:28:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,less than 30 minutes to do this before he shows up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.28,1:28:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's enough time for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.52,1:28:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you handle this，Kim？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.80,1:28:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do I have to do？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.12,1:28:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keep me up to date on what comes up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.84,1:28:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.44,1:28:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector，the tape you gave us from that gas station…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.04,1:28:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,here are the stills，frame by frame.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.32,1:28:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.48,1:28:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,He lied to you about where he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.04,1:28:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What a surprise。- He's downtown.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.12,1:28:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's call out the cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.32,1:28:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.68,1:28:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're out of this location！We're on the move！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.68,1:28:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.00,1:28:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Cops on the move.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.04,1:28:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.72,1:28:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do exactly as you were told.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.64,1:28:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't improvise.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.88,1:29:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try anything funny，and they'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.04,1:29:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if they don't，I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.72,1:29:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know how many times I can say sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.00,1:29:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.28,1:29:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.52,1:29:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dotzler.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.68,1:29:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found out something you might wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.32,1:29:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matching insurance policies on St。John and his wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.68,1:29:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,$12 million。Each.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.92,1:29:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about that？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.56,1:30:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart St。John。Mr。Malankov's expecting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.88,1:30:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's in the bag？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.32,1:30:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.00,1:30:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.00,1:30:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart St。John is clear。Unlock the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.76,1:30:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.68,1:30:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.32,1:30:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.72,1:30:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.76,1:30:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.48,1:30:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.84,1:30:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back to the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.88,1:31:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.88,1:31:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.80,1:31:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.56,1:31:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.80,1:31:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Showtime。Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.04,1:31:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.80,1:31:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.36,1:31:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.88,1:35:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.12,1:35:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get up！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.24,1:35:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you，old man？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.36,1:35:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You killed my ex-wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.96,1:35:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you're not gonna kill my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.76,1:36:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your daughter？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.64,1:36:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.16,1:36:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are fucked by the same man.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.48,1:36:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.16,1:36:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart St。John.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.48,1:36:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，he gets me to kill your wife…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.80,1:36:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,then you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.40,1:36:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when that doesn't work…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.92,1:36:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,he pushes you to kill me，no？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.72,1:36:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Either way，he wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.88,1:36:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your wife was just part of a business deal like many before her.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.68,1:36:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is my turn to lose the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.92,1:36:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finish me！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.68,1:36:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finish me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.16,1:36:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.08,1:36:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.20,1:36:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.40,1:37:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.76,1:37:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.04,1:37:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad？- What is it，Kim？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.60,1:37:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.84,1:37:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam！Sam！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.44,1:37:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.60,1:37:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.68,1:37:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。Move。- Kim！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.32,1:37:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in the car！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.76,1:37:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.20,1:37:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are we going？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.44,1:37:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.36,1:38:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's still alive。Let's get a medic in here… ASAP！Medic！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.88,1:38:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.96,1:38:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The elevator！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.68,1:38:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dotzler，it's Smith。We're in Malankov's building.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.96,1:38:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think… Mills is here。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.80,1:38:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We're gonna check the apartment now.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.00,1:38:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.12,1:38:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Can you move？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.28,1:38:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back it up。Back it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.52,1:39:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，let's go。Everybody in.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.00,1:39:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.88,1:39:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,This guy's still warm。We got a good chance he's still in the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.64,1:39:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call downstairs，lock it up。Nobody in，nobody out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.92,1:39:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lock it up。Nobody in，nobody out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.16,1:40:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Text from your phone asking Mom to meet you…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.84,1:40:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,「at the Rancho Berrego the night she died.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.76,1:40:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Someone used your phone？」
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.02,1:40:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Santa Monica Aviation。- This is Mr。St。John.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.68,1:40:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be there in 15 minutes。Get the plane ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.16,1:40:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.88,1:40:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.72,1:41:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because your father and his friends are homicidal maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.84,1:41:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're a lying piece of shit。- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.72,1:41:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You killed her！I know…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.00,1:41:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.40,1:41:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.00,1:41:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.36,1:41:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want the full work-up on a black Porsche，license plate number 6-8-9-M-J-C-6.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.88,1:41:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.00,1:41:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Connect me to the Porsche phone and trace it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.48,1:41:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.16,1:41:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need a run on a California plate
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.88,1:41:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,6-8-9-Mary-Jane-Charlie-6.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.00,1:41:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need a phone，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.04,1:41:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.56,1:41:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Black Porsche's phone position received.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.04,1:41:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heading west.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.44,1:41:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.48,1:41:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，Mr。Mills.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.76,1:41:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Dotzler.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.88,1:41:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've started to piece this thing together.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.68,1:41:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's two life insurance policies.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.24,1:41:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,One for St。John，one for your ex-wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.08,1:41:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You understand？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.72,1:42:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart owed money to these Russians.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.44,1:42:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,A lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.56,1:42:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ones who abducted her.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.72,1:42:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then they took her to my place
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.12,1:42:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,and killed her to keep me out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.96,1:42:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to step back…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.44,1:42:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,and allow me to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.88,1:42:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.04,1:42:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your first priority here，Inspector？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.24,1:42:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,To arrest St。John
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.52,1:42:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and charge him with your ex-wife's murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.24,1:42:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,My first priority is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.76,1:42:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.72,1:42:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.96,1:42:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.40,1:42:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，we're leaving now。Come on，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.64,1:42:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.28,1:43:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Approaching Runway Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.84,1:43:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.28,1:43:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，guys。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.84,1:43:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Requesting permission for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.96,1:43:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a visual on the Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.96,1:43:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's heading to Santa Monica airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.36,1:43:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want all units in the area of the Santa Monica airport…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.12,1:43:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,to be on the lookout for a black Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.54,1:43:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,49-90.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.51,1:43:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Taxiways are closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.68,1:43:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.24,1:43:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.80,1:44:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on！- We don't have enough speed！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.00,1:44:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.88,1:44:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the goddamn gun！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.24,1:44:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the goddamn gun！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.72,1:44:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll shoot you in the head！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.88,1:44:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.36,1:44:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very smart…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.24,1:44:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,playing me off against the Russian.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.88,1:45:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coming over for coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.24,1:45:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Taking my phone，sending texts and then erasing them.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.28,1:45:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,So that your pals could plant Lenore's body…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.04,1:45:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,and make it look as if I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.24,1:45:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,All your problems solved.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.92,1:45:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,All your worries over.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.88,1:45:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it didn't quite work out that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.96,1:45:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，listen，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.60,1:45:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.56,1:45:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.60,1:45:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.44,1:45:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.28,1:45:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you know a lot of people…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.68,1:45:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and with a good lawyer，you'll get out of jail in a few years.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.80,1:45:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then I'll come for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.32,1:46:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.44,1:46:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we both know what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.52,1:46:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.52,1:46:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was the bagels.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.08,1:46:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.04,1:47:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to ask myself…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.24,1:47:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,what kind of guy goes out for warm bagels…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.04,1:47:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,and comes back and commits murder？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.52,1:47:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，I compared the timestamps to the deleted texts…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.24,1:47:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you downloaded from our computers.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.68,1:47:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which，by the way，is illegal，and I could arrest you for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.36,1:47:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could。But it's got me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.72,1:47:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I was able to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.04,1:47:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was leaving him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.04,1:47:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,He needed the insurance money to pay Malankov.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.72,1:47:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't help us out by escaping，you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.72,1:47:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,He figured，
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.86,1:47:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,what better way to get rid of Malankov and keep the insurance money…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.96,1:47:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,than by getting me
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.36,1:47:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,to kill the guy who would kill him…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.88,1:47:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,because it was the only way to keep my daughter safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.24,1:47:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.20,1:47:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.64,1:47:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，are we done，Inspector？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.24,1:47:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.40,1:48:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course we're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.32,1:48:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.12,1:48:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you… just stay in town for the next month or so…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.12,1:48:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,just in case I have any other questions for you？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.12,1:48:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.12,1:48:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.60,1:48:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've thought about this all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.32,1:48:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a very important choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.80,1:48:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever you decide…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.32,1:49:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,the two of you，together…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.48,1:49:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll support you 100%.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.44,1:49:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know your mom would have said the same thing，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.68,1:49:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tell him。- Dad…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.80,1:49:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,we've been talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.68,1:49:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,We thought that…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.04,1:49:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,if it's a girl…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.88,1:49:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,we'd like to name her after mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.40,1:49:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'd like that very much，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的支票簿放哪了 - 在楼下客厅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出门遛一下狗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公室真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,合家欢乐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么晚打扰您真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过… 有个小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老板欠我钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来取钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个会计 我什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要知道保险柜的密码就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你总该知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,知… 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 有劳了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,本机号码310-5550199 请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友你好 我是曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来你办公室取钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果竹篮打水一场空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我会给你留份回礼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你长长记性
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的耐心要耗尽了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,代我向您家人问好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:34.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,《飓风营救3》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:46.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生日快乐）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,多大了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们长到多大 总是我们的宝贝孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得太对了 来吧 大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已怀孕）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离我生日还有三天呢 - 你总是说我循规蹈矩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想改变一下 不那么墨守成规了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 高脚杯在哪 - 你又不是不了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪来的高脚杯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者一个巨大的毛绒熊猫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不太礼貌啊 - 我是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我早就不是七岁了 - 我可以把它还回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么先放你这 等你自己的孩子七岁大的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 宝贝 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看谁来了 - 米尔斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 吉米
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 - 挺好的 你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那样呗 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 要是你们父女俩想独处的话 我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我只是路过进来看看 想要… 打破成规
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆总是说我太循规蹈矩了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真有意思 你居然还好意思说别人循规蹈矩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不循规蹈矩呢 - 得了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天她都去同一家商店
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,离学校不远 每天早上上学前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 买杯一模一样的桃子酸奶 对吧 - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从后面数第四个不是第五 也不是第三 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为第四个冰得恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么一来 等她课间休息喝的时候 它还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是… 很冰的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我也会干一样的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 强迫症遗传
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这香槟是干嘛的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,预先庆祝一下生日
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:08:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸你要是不介意 我是觉得现在喝酒早了点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它放冰箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就留你俩二人世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸别…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿走 这下我心里不好受了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你是该不好受
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去换个更循规蹈矩的礼物来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱你 - 吉米保重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了吗 - 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想静一静 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我爱你 爸爸）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好系好安全带 菲利普
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.32,0:09:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得不能再好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜熊猫不太吃香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别瞎说 人家正坐我旁边呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是什么时候长大的 丽诺尔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 时间过得太快 所有事都是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,正要回家 做点晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想不想跟我们一起 - 我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和熊猫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 要不还是下次再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有熊猫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都答应了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变主意了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你的门虚掩着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有太冒昧吧… - 当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正准备晚餐呢 来一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你能过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看起来有点焦虑 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和斯图尔特…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都试过了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理治疗 咨询 无论是两个人一起还是单独去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是真心想挽回
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我在伤害他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是什么都感觉不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这种麻木的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌走过场的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一感受到的就是被困住了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对男人的品味差劲透顶了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在说你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我幻想什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢问
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪恶感就淹没了我 让我感觉自己真不是东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是说明我是个坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃着碗里的 看着锅里的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很迷茫 但不是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定觉得我疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 如果连你都疯了 你肯定不是唯一一个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,该道歉的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我不想 但… 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在你和斯图尔特撇清关系之前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这样做弊大于利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对每个人都是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在装什么清高
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我也希望我能放下架子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我… 我得走了 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出趟差 一个月的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想独自去个清净的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你增肌了六磅 - 你们太会欺负我了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉可提高不了你的挥杆准度
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个洞你多用了两杆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 还是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们其他人来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说真的 有钱拿 有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我去不成 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是四个人的活计 没有你我们办不成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 但手头来了几件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一个月一时走不开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老兄 你得放开了 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽诺尔是个成年人 她能照顾好自己
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是她丈夫了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她是我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你最好找个人谈谈心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理咨询
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你们几个我还要什么心理咨询
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,此言倒是不假
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来个人取下旗杆好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 金姆 什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我帮你拿出来 - 如果你不介意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键一球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是难得的款待
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 呃… 需要您的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这大概是我之前根本没有计划过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至想都没有想过的… 从来没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.16,0:14:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我想听听您的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,受宠若惊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真不好意思 别闹了 - 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别不信 那小鬼过几年就是个大麻烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想问什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小狗 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想要不要养条小狗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友在大楼后面找到一只
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想给它找个家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把信息挂在脸书上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人来认领 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我怎么想吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这意味着很大的工作量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重的一份责任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,相比你的生活方式 而且你还在上学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直得待在小狗身边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂它 遛它 这跟…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,养个孩子没什么区别
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看过菜单了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没呢 安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯图尔特 - 嗨 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,方便进来说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没问题 我正在煮咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要加奶加糖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 都要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 奶要冷的热的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 热的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 生意怎么样 - 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候还不错 有时候非常不错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一块糖 还是两块
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,两块吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉这么晚还来打扰你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得这样更…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,能体现我对你谈话的尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如面对面 一对一这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道丽诺尔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你讲过我们之间的问题你是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 我挺喜欢你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个值得尊敬的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我没有任何责怪你的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 如果要想挽回我和丽诺尔的婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夹在我们当中肯定是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和丽诺尔之间除了金姆之外 一清二白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说你们不清白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,明显
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们共同的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也努力试着做一个好父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在某些情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这意味着你们俩之间会交流 联系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是希望你能别再见我的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们之间的问题解决为止
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道你来我这吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知不知道不重要 这不是重点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在要求你以后别见我的妻子 你能做到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道我今晚得去拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天还有会要开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不想心里还惦记着…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你懂的 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来见我 急事 带点甜甜圈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:53.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（丽诺尔：拜托了）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来四个甜甜圈 再来点奶油干酪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心烫手 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:25.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（甜甜圈）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.72,0:19:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒醒 快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉妮 - 住手 不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,离那把刀远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把手举起来 - 先生 马上退后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们得听我说 - 快跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跪下 - 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从那把刀旁边挪开 - 立刻跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起来 举高点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.84,0:20:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 到那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 他在往西面逃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正往树林跑 速度很快 请支援
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到疑犯了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 警察
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 门被封住了 靠 - 我刚刚看见他在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全 我进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.52,0:23:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见他了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 他逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是103 嫌疑人逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.67,0:23:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 夕阳落水 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 波澜四起 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 载我远行 恍恍荡荡 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.59,0:24:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 惊涛骇浪 不绝于耳 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 重拾希冀 翻阅新篇 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 潮起潮落 响彻天际 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.88,0:24:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 是爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.76,0:24:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.36,0:24:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在妈妈这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找我的黄色毛衣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.12,0:24:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.88,0:24:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特在拉斯维加斯 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.80,0:24:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.40,0:24:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 出什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:25:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可怕的事情发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.40,0:25:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想先亲口告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.84,0:25:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.32,0:25:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人谋杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的公寓里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像是我杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.72,0:25:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么也不知道是谁干的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.52,0:25:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我会找到真相的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听清楚了 金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.40,0:25:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管别人说什么 不要相信他们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.72,0:25:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 - 明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会想办法联系你的 - 爸
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚强一点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.08,0:25:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.76,0:25:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.10,0:25:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得检查一下这个 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,多兹勒警长 嫌疑人名叫布莱恩·米尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的吗 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.84,0:26:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.00,0:26:28.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加州驾照）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的警官为什么能碰巧看见他
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.80,0:26:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接到了电话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.32,0:26:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,声称听到一个女人尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.72,0:26:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他要杀我 他要杀我」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.72,0:26:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她名叫丽诺尔·圣约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根据她证件上的地址派了一辆警车
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.36,0:26:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的女儿在那里 但是她的丈夫在拉斯维加斯出差
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.88,0:26:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会 呃 乘最早的一班航班回家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.16,0:26:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有证人吗 - 摄像头什么都没有拍到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话来自于未登记的号码
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会查一下他们的手机
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.64,0:26:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这两台手机的信息都下载下来 整理数据
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.36,0:26:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道这两人什么时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.64,0:27:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊天 发短信 发邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.32,0:27:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何形式的联系都要
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.36,0:27:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间 次数
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话时长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.84,0:27:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些打包带走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.76,0:27:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,警探 把它打包
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.72,0:27:18.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（甜甜圈）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对劲的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.88,0:27:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道不错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.28,0:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在正在一起刚刚发生的犯罪现场
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.16,0:27:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查员们在现场待了一整个上午
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.88,0:27:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是到目前为止
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方还没有告诉我们该公寓里到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.12,0:27:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晨这里发现了一具女性尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.88,0:27:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·米尔斯是这家公寓的户主
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.20,0:27:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时也是受害者的前夫
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁啊 - 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.64,0:27:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上新闻了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我干的 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.20,0:27:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然不是你啊 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去次秘密基地 密码没变吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.48,0:28:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊 丝毫未变
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.88,0:28:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会保持联系的 - 小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.08,0:28:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是我们跟丢他的地方 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.88,0:28:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就这么消失不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.44,0:28:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把就是他从我们一位警官那儿抢来的枪 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.20,0:28:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有枪 他还没有朝你开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.16,0:28:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那直升机呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.72,0:28:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.20,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机什么都没有发现 警长
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.44,0:28:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.60,0:28:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.20,0:28:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能凭空消失
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 把卡车移开
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.72,0:30:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么你的妻子会去见米尔斯先生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.08,0:30:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我… 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们之间的关系主要是围绕他们的女儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.28,0:30:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.84,0:30:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要的不止是朋友关系
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫她去和他谈谈…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.32,0:30:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他别再来为此打扰她的生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.52,0:30:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你认为这就是为什么她会过去
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.88,0:30:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.12,0:30:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特 为什么他们在翻妈妈的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.32,0:30:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.28,0:30:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣约翰女士 在下是弗兰克·多兹勒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.48,0:30:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯 我姓米尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.50,0:31:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.50,0:31:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想看看有没有能帮助查案的线索
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.68,0:31:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们在找什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.40,0:31:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.04,0:31:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能离开我妈妈的卧室几分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.16,0:31:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,加西亚 撤出卧室里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.20,0:31:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都从卧室里出来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.56,0:31:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.24,0:31:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能挤出点时间和我聊聊吗 我想问你一些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.24,0:31:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不在外面寻找凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.08,0:31:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是在我们家乱晃
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派了人在外寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为了让我能把握全局
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得问他还有你一些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.40,0:31:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈去见我爸爸了 我不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.28,0:31:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是为了聊我的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.64,0:31:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他干的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.16,0:31:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他 不是我爸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.16,0:31:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸绝对不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.76,0:32:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.84,0:32:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道这些
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.64,0:32:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的 不是我妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.40,0:32:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.76,0:33:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.56,0:33:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.76,0:33:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们把你送回家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.52,0:33:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想到什么 请联系我们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.88,0:33:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这可能不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.28,0:33:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴黎和伊斯坦布尔发生了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.84,0:33:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 布莱恩救了他的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.20,0:33:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你觉得和这事有联系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.92,0:33:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道我从来不想了解那些细节…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.88,0:33:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是很多人为此失去了性命 现在又发生了这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.44,0:33:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你想说的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.12,0:33:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我面对的是一个十分危险的人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.20,0:33:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.64,0:33:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩并不危险
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.80,0:33:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他所生活的世界却很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.92,0:34:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱他的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他树敌不少
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.00,0:34:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带到3号房间
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.64,0:34:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,加西亚会把你送回家
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.64,0:34:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.54,0:34:48.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（丽诺尔·圣约翰）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.54,0:36:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙像幽灵一样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.48,0:36:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他21岁时 入伍
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.84,0:36:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,23岁时 加入了特种部队
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.48,0:36:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.68,0:36:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有服役记录
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.52,0:36:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有退役记录
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.76,0:36:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有 全是空白
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是个间谍
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.60,0:36:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且直到我们找到其他的嫌疑人 他就是头号嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.12,0:36:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们能找到他的最好方法 他和被害人的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.40,0:36:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,被害人丈夫说他和他的女儿关系十分亲密
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.16,0:36:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,全身心地爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.24,0:36:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们密切监视她
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.56,0:36:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去哪里 打给谁电话 和谁交流
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.20,0:36:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把这事搞砸了 明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.84,0:36:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这就是我们找到他的最好机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.52,0:36:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被害人的车呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.20,0:36:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚送来 布莱恩的也有
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 加西亚 史密斯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.76,0:36:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细搜查那辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.84,0:36:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,下载GPS记录 找到它何时在何处
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.84,0:36:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看是否有关联
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.72,0:36:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们能否发现到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.52,0:37:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们俩的车刚刚送到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.32,0:37:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.40,0:37:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.76,0:37:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.16,0:37:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人杀掉了他的前妻
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.68,0:37:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.56,0:37:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 据说是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.30,0:37:50.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（GPS记录 下载中）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.72,0:37:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是在车里杀的吧 - 不是 在他家里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.68,0:37:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我讨厌事后处理那种东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.76,0:38:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,血迹 恶心死人的尸体啊什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.25,0:38:06.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（GPS记录 下载完成）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.60,0:38:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想先弄哪部车的GPS
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.44,0:38:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的 再弄她的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.44,0:38:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.59,0:38:26.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（丽诺尔·圣约翰 GPS记录）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.36,0:38:29.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（晚上10点04分 兰乔）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.56,0:38:35.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（兰乔加油站）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.64,0:38:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽诺尔 你到底去那里干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.66,0:38:41.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（兰乔加油站）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.36,0:38:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.12,0:38:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是洛杉矶警局的的马丽警官
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.44,0:38:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在调查一个失踪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.36,0:38:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道你是否见过这个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.32,0:38:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚约十点的时候她到过这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.20,0:39:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚上班的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.64,0:39:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没看见她 几乎没有看见任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.40,0:39:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不是个买东西的好地方 你懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.56,0:39:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 萨拉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.92,0:39:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.12,0:39:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有活了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.64,0:39:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.28,0:39:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.92,0:39:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是洛杉矶警局的的马丽警官
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.24,0:39:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些监控摄像头在运行还是只是装装样子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.64,0:39:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 它们在运行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.92,0:39:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.88,0:39:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有昨天的监控录像带吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.52,0:39:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 昨天不是我上班 是另一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.24,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只要有人 就肯定留了录像
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.40,0:39:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,按那个按钮回放即可
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.48,0:39:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看的时候我就待在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:50.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小老弟监视系统）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.80,0:39:52.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（3号摄影机画面）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.80,0:40:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个系统有问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.64,0:40:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的时候会坏掉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.92,0:40:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直说要换掉它
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.28,0:40:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.88,0:40:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这个女人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.76,0:40:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群人得协调好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,协调 你什么意思 协调好衣服颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.96,0:40:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 你们的人刚来这儿问我相同的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.12,0:40:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的人？- 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.60,0:40:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他 - 是啊 就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.68,0:40:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了加油站
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.44,0:41:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.88,0:41:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.72,0:41:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.08,0:41:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出来 哥们 出来 - 快点出去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.92,0:41:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.44,0:41:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下手里的动作 米尔斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.12,0:41:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开那张桌子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.64,0:41:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开那桌子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.84,0:41:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点退后 我会开枪的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.40,0:41:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我开枪了 - 马上给老子退后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.64,0:41:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后一步 离开那桌子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.76,0:41:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来 让我们看到你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.00,0:41:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住别动
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.92,0:42:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道程序的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.16,0:42:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所说的一切都将成为呈堂证供
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.16,0:42:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权请律师
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.84,0:42:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你付不起律师费的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.40,0:42:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布鲁克斯 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.04,0:43:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是加西亚和史密斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.32,0:43:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逮到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.84,0:43:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 逮到了 - 是的 刚刚逮捕的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.68,0:43:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单极了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.96,0:43:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他真的跟你说的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.68,0:43:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,专业的也有失手的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.28,0:43:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是在耍你 - 你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.16,0:43:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在哪里 在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.48,0:43:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普斯看着呢 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.80,0:43:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停车 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.04,0:43:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,都停车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.20,0:43:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.48,0:43:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 菲利普斯 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.56,0:43:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,头儿貌似有什么不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.20,0:43:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯紧点那家伙 懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.96,0:43:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.32,0:43:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们还以为我们是白痴 - 真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.04,0:43:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的好像我从来没抓过人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.76,0:43:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,多兹勒就那样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.48,0:43:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是 知道为什么吗 他就是个控制狂
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.16,0:43:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是他亲手抓的人 他就不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.64,0:44:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续开
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.76,0:44:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.88,0:44:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.96,0:45:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 看见没 他到底想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.84,0:45:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.12,0:46:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒车
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.00,0:46:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.52,0:46:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.88,0:46:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.20,0:46:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 下车
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.80,0:46:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.24,0:46:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.48,0:46:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这下子没好果子吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.72,0:46:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么悲观
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.64,0:46:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,接入加州警局警员档案
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.43,0:46:57.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已连接服务器 传输进度）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.09,0:46:59.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（数据传输中）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.48,0:47:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫所有警员追捕嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.68,0:47:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正驾驶尾号706的警车
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.92,0:47:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,尾号706
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.16,0:47:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现嫌疑犯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.52,0:47:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那 在那
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.44,0:48:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 就位 就位
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.23,0:48:27.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（传输完成）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是多兹勒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.00,0:49:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你知道我是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.00,0:49:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能耐了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.84,0:49:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有点了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.52,0:49:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你个问题 这样我就能明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.60,0:49:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你66 67年是中情局特工 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.08,0:49:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要知道我是无辜的就行
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.72,0:49:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我两天时间 我证明给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.44,0:49:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找出真凶的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.44,0:49:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有可能是无辜的 米尔斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这由法庭来决断 跟我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.32,0:49:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做的就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.52,0:49:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你送上法庭 让事实说话 仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.00,0:49:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那祝你好运了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.96,0:50:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有那通电话的定位了 他朝南部走了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.04,0:50:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我派人过去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.96,0:50:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用麻烦了 他已经消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.28,0:50:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这线索断了 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.32,0:50:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么把这个留给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.64,0:50:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他失手了 - 这家伙可不会失手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.48,0:50:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要我们看录像
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.12,0:50:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.60,0:50:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我暂时不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.60,0:50:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在等谁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.00,0:50:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.84,0:50:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 这些人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.12,0:50:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有监控录像要处理 立刻马上派个技术人员过来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.36,0:51:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我猜猜
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.00,0:51:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,710北线严重堵车
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.20,0:51:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,被大量警车向南追捕15英里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.32,0:51:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.52,0:51:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 谢谢 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.80,0:51:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算告诉我怎么回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.40,0:51:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽诺尔发了短信给我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.16,0:51:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想来我家吃甜甜圈
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.24,0:51:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出门买了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.48,0:51:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等回来的时候 我看到她的车停在门前
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.04,0:51:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 她被人割了喉咙 死在我的床上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.20,0:51:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.40,0:51:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.68,0:51:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从她车里的GPS
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.84,0:51:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了昨晚她去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.24,0:51:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到了一个荒无人烟的加油站
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.36,0:51:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了那边的监控录像
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.28,0:51:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是被绑架走的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.68,0:52:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我们做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.28,0:52:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从警局档案里下载了她所有的电话记录 目前还在查
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.72,0:52:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许里面会有什么信息
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.36,0:52:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前还没注意
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.88,0:52:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的头发 也许有用 也许没用
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.04,0:52:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么其他的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.92,0:52:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去参加她的葬礼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.56,0:52:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣经一直告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.88,0:52:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命中总是充满了艰辛
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.96,0:52:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们走在黑暗无光
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.88,0:52:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,危机四伏的小道时
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.72,0:52:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一条死气沉沉的小道时 - 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.08,0:52:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是全能的上帝却说得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.56,0:52:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们经历这种情形的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.88,0:52:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝会指引我们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.56,0:52:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到安全的彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.44,0:52:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会引领我们走过困境
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.24,0:52:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以圣父
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.80,0:52:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.60,0:52:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣灵之名
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:52:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.12,0:53:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.84,0:53:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把音频调出来 就那个人的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.44,0:53:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.48,0:53:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能帮什么忙的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.44,0:53:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.80,0:53:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.12,0:53:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.28,0:53:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 宝贝 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.48,0:53:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想回家而已
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.68,0:53:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.20,0:53:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到杂音了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.44,0:53:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了 我这边接收到一些电子干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.68,0:53:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去跟金姆说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.88,0:53:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.88,0:53:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.36,0:53:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在干扰我们的信号
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.96,0:53:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.56,0:53:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的觉得很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.00,0:53:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.56,0:53:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会联络你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.32,0:53:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,和以前日常作息一样就行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.20,0:53:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,按你最循规蹈矩的作息就行
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.78,0:54:29.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无讯号）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.36,0:54:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我跟踪他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.92,0:54:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 浪费时间而已 他们总有办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.60,0:54:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你派警犬去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.96,0:54:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还是能甩掉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.76,0:54:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完事了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.08,0:54:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,切了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.28,0:55:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特 为什么还是有…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.40,0:55:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么家外面还是有警察
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.04,0:55:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计是他们的标准流程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.56,0:55:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我爸会来这里吗 他们是傻还是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.64,0:55:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道他们想怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.00,0:55:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,多兹勒警长问我介不介意 我说不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.96,0:55:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你也应该问问我 我介意
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.44,0:55:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.80,0:55:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.60,0:55:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们… 我们需要保护
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.76,0:55:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.92,0:55:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你心里肯定很难过 其实我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.40,0:55:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我都不知道 原来是在比谁更可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.00,0:55:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是比可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.76,0:55:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别记恨我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.16,0:55:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生这一切也不能怪我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.00,0:56:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不恨你 多兹勒
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.44,0:56:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但近两年来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.60,0:56:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次看到妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.04,0:56:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都是那副受伤可怜的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.60,0:56:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭这点
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.04,0:56:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对要负责
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.28,0:56:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这是要去哪里 - 去学校
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.12,0:56:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还允许我去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:56:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着你呢 宝贝 我跟得上
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.68,0:57:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要跟着我 - 是为了你自己的安全 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.60,0:57:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全？谁会威胁我？我爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.84,0:57:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真的觉得我爸会伤害我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈之前估计也没想到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.20,0:57:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.04,0:57:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.84,0:57:49.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喝掉我）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.40,0:58:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么情况吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.60,0:58:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在学校了 你要我跟着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.44,0:58:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 监听器还在吗 - 在的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.08,0:58:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听清楚了 如果他露面 我们马上赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.56,0:58:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有什么情况 - 她去了家便利店
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.96,0:58:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了一瓶饮料一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.60,0:58:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.96,0:58:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时报告情况
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.72,0:59:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家也许还记得 上周我们讨论了…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.88,0:59:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,视皮层背侧和腹侧 在感知物体认知时的区别和联系…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.68,0:59:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,多普勒假说是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.04,0:59:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,视皮层背侧通路是用来感知物体运动的联系
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.36,0:59:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而腹侧通路则相对独立的构建
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.32,0:59:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于物体的更多的视觉信息…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.72,0:59:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点想吐
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.88,0:59:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我记下笔记吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.48,0:59:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.04,0:59:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,换言之 认知对象在腹侧通路中…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.84,0:59:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你能帮我个忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.52,0:59:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 这照片上的姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.32,0:59:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个小时前来过吗 - 来过啊 可怜的小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.32,0:59:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她经常来吗 - 每天都来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.92,1:00:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她买了什么 - 每天一瓶桃子酸奶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.00,1:00:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天她在冰箱那边就喝完了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.92,1:00:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是太渴了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.52,1:00:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.60,1:00:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去了学校 上课时觉得有点难受
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.96,1:00:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她去洗手间了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.56,1:00:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫支援
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.76,1:00:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上过来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.56,1:01:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 把这个喝了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.84,1:01:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在酸奶里放了让你难受的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.08,1:01:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能中和难受的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.48,1:01:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.08,1:01:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.20,1:01:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.36,1:01:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.12,1:01:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 我不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.64,1:01:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.28,1:01:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.48,1:01:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.72,1:01:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.92,1:02:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.64,1:02:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有低血糖
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.20,1:02:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从昨天开始就没吃过东西了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.88,1:02:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.64,1:02:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别… 别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.00,1:02:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先挺过眼下这关…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.24,1:02:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我们再从长计议
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.48,1:02:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 你要做的就是自然点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.64,1:02:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些警察不蠢的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.48,1:02:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何奇怪的举动
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.00,1:02:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都会产生怀疑 懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.68,1:02:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.52,1:02:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.20,1:02:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.20,1:03:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在科学楼东翼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.72,1:03:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在厕所里 - 站着别动 等我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.20,1:03:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在住哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.92,1:03:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在妈妈家里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.08,1:03:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在整理她的遗物
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.44,1:03:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 一切都太突然了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.04,1:03:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.88,1:03:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.20,1:03:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 那是…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.40,1:03:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特最近真的很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.08,1:03:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是在害怕什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.92,1:03:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他雇了保镖
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.04,1:03:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.24,1:03:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真有意思 但你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.88,1:03:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他就是这么个混蛋 - 真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.88,1:03:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在酒吧里 他让我付自己的酒钱
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.60,1:03:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我当时穿得比这还要暴露呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.44,1:03:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比这还暴露吗 - 我都不清楚发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.72,1:03:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他瞎了 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.24,1:03:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.56,1:04:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他就是这么个混蛋 - 我不会再在那么做了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.00,1:04:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我看到他了 我完全理解
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.60,1:04:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很性感 对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.08,1:04:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出去 出去 - 这就走
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.60,1:04:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 出去 快出去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.68,1:04:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.28,1:04:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.12,1:04:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,色鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.96,1:04:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚走
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.60,1:04:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在厕所里
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.12,1:04:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你走
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.32,1:04:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁出口
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.52,1:04:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.32,1:05:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.84,1:05:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要拦住他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.16,1:05:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.16,1:05:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.56,1:05:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.68,1:05:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出去 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.92,1:05:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 快跑 快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.72,1:06:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你认为自己在帮他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.12,1:06:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实没有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.88,1:06:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.04,1:06:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不建议你这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.72,1:06:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法解释发生的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.48,1:06:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人杀了我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.88,1:06:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.60,1:06:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我爸爸干的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.40,1:06:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没听他的说辞 他们没办法了解 对吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.12,1:06:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.48,1:06:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有事吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.92,1:06:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能以你妨碍公务的名义逮捕你 你知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.76,1:06:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.08,1:06:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.96,1:06:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这样 如果你不逮捕我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.96,1:06:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我能回家吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.68,1:06:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.08,1:07:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.12,1:07:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的一家人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.96,1:07:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.60,1:07:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会搞定这事 按我们的计划去做
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.96,1:07:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫车
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.32,1:07:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪儿 老大
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.04,1:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,马利布的房子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.12,1:09:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们去喝酒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.36,1:10:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.56,1:10:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要搭车 我来开 好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.12,1:10:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.64,1:10:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字 - 麦克
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.68,1:10:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫布莱恩 你有孩子吗 麦克
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.64,1:10:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.52,1:10:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几岁 - 欧文三岁 特里七岁
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.80,1:10:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年纪不错
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.84,1:10:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你条建议 珍惜和他们相处的每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.36,1:10:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你没反应过来之前 他们就会有自己的孩子了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.84,1:10:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白我的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.80,1:11:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 麦克
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.52,1:11:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你带着一盒火柴 站在外面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.80,1:11:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以马上唤来成百上千只兔子
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.56,1:11:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道怎么做到吗 - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.36,1:11:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有兔子 来报到
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.20,1:11:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有兔子 来报到 就像这样
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.56,1:13:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁雇的你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.88,1:14:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在替谁做事
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.48,1:14:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的口音真难听
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.00,1:14:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在替谁做事
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.96,1:14:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死也不告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.92,1:14:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.20,1:14:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大 他们在门口
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.48,1:14:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们进来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.76,1:14:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你出去会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.92,1:14:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要自己待会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.60,1:15:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.80,1:15:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.72,1:15:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.36,1:15:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.76,1:16:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生的这一切事 我看不明白 斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.72,1:16:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来指望你能帮我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.76,1:16:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.08,1:16:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没被撞死
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.12,1:16:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟踪你的时候 那些俄国人在跟踪我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.04,1:16:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是你指使的吧 斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.36,1:16:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我不知道你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.68,1:16:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.88,1:16:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道你上了我老婆
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.44,1:16:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道她死了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.60,1:16:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不要…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.88,1:16:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.08,1:16:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.64,1:16:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.00,1:16:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要是相信 我们就不会在这儿了 - 不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.12,1:16:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.52,1:16:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.92,1:16:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.36,1:16:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥列格·曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.80,1:16:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥列格·曼伦科夫是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.04,1:17:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠了他钱
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.60,1:17:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识他
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.16,1:17:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝不会放弃的 对他来说 只是游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.80,1:17:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我输了一切 他说要杀了我的家人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.60,1:17:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不报警 你让他们以为人是我杀的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.44,1:17:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被你气疯了 你答应过
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.04,1:17:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你答应不再见她的 - 你以为发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.56,1:17:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到我那儿来 曼伦科夫跟她到了那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.96,1:17:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你没有背着我见她
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.36,1:17:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本就不会去你家 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.32,1:17:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会在别的地方杀她
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.12,1:17:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们为什么要追杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.52,1:17:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我告诉了他们你以前的身份
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.84,1:17:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你会找到并杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.80,1:17:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这多便宜了你啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.16,1:17:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀他们 你的债就没了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.08,1:17:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.00,1:17:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我爱她 你要相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.32,1:17:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱她 我爱她
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.64,1:17:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.48,1:17:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找警察 告诉他们一切
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.04,1:17:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.40,1:17:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 他是个疯子 你不了解他
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.84,1:17:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做什么都可以 反正…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.20,1:17:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是个死人了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.00,1:18:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.32,1:18:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了你 就收不回债了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.60,1:18:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是他们下一个要追杀的人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.88,1:18:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.36,1:18:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.36,1:18:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把你的钥匙拿出来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.40,1:18:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道自己在做什么吗 哥们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.24,1:18:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 事实上 我很清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.64,1:18:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能拿着你的钥匙和手机吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.20,1:18:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把手放在方向盘上吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.44,1:18:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然怎样 你要干嘛 开枪打我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.04,1:18:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,左腿还是右腿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.12,1:18:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续 把手铐起来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.96,1:19:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.60,1:19:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.64,1:19:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.04,1:19:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.56,1:19:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在保护你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.44,1:19:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.56,1:19:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 金姆 我们上车去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.40,1:19:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.60,1:20:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.60,1:20:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯纳德·哈里斯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.68,1:20:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个职业狙击手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.20,1:20:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,24岁离开军队
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.64,1:20:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后毫无记录
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.28,1:20:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他和其他两个人一起成立了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.60,1:20:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的国际私人安保公司
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.52,1:20:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外两个人 一个叫凯西·马克
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.68,1:20:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海军陆战队服役八年
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.40,1:20:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆破专家 写着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.72,1:20:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再次找到他踪迹的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.12,1:20:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他45岁 已经成为
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.04,1:20:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际私人安保公司的副总裁
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.76,1:20:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·格罗斯曼 通讯专家
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.12,1:20:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个行家
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.28,1:20:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是国际私人安保公司的首席运营官
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.52,1:21:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 我们的头号疑犯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.08,1:21:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·米尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.08,1:21:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是国际私人安保公司的「雇员」
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.84,1:21:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.32,1:21:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人非常厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.64,1:21:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.16,1:21:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会把你们耍得团团转
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.72,1:21:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们立刻制止他们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.32,1:21:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事 看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.36,1:21:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个俄国人 自杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.32,1:21:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为他不想把米尔斯想要的情报
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.32,1:21:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.08,1:21:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为显然 他没想杀你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.84,1:21:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然他没想杀任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.64,1:21:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是想收集情报
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.48,1:21:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是想弄清这件事 和我们一样
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.76,1:21:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了他领先了我们一步
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.12,1:22:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要弄清楚这些俄国人和他老婆的谋杀案
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.72,1:22:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,之间的关系
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.04,1:22:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这四个人中 总有人知道些什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.72,1:22:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道答案
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.72,1:22:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们找到他们
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.00,1:22:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带回来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.08,1:22:25.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（资料分析）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.08,1:22:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到线索了吗 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.60,1:22:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我的样本里什么也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.12,1:22:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 梳理数据需要些时间
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.68,1:22:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 数据太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.80,1:22:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.60,1:22:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下载了警方电脑的信息
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.80,1:22:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做什么 - 他们首先会看通话记录
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.82,1:22:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找线索
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.44,1:22:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和丽诺尔的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.68,1:22:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会说明什么 你和丽诺尔互相通话
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.52,1:22:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 不要担心 我们就快结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.48,1:22:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.04,1:22:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是保证我女儿的安全
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.12,1:22:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而唯一的办法 看来就是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.28,1:22:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,清除对她不利的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.92,1:22:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.28,1:23:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明 斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.68,1:23:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.32,1:23:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮忙的 对吧 就像诱饵帮助捕鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.52,1:23:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.88,1:23:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,先说说曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.64,1:23:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道每个细节
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.24,1:23:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁 做什么 住哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.36,1:23:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作地点
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.32,1:23:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥列格·曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.64,1:23:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常强悍
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.00,1:23:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联侵略阿富汗时
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.56,1:23:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在军队服役
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.96,1:23:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入了斯佩茨纳兹（前苏联特种部队）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.88,1:23:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们的海豹突击队
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.12,1:23:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时每个人都在抢夺他们能抢夺的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.04,1:23:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联解体后
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.80,1:23:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有他这样技术的人有大量的需求
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.80,1:23:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成了掠夺者之一
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.72,1:23:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做重型机械生意时 遇见了他
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.12,1:23:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,自那以后 我们在很多不同的场合做生意
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.12,1:23:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些交易很成功
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.04,1:24:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有钱
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.00,1:24:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最后一次失败了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.52,1:24:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.48,1:24:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈是因为你一单失败的生意而死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.60,1:24:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.76,1:24:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.68,1:24:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.68,1:24:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要他
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.36,1:24:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要他
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.64,1:24:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他打电话
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.00,1:24:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.24,1:24:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你要约他 为我设个局
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.08,1:24:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话 马上
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.56,1:24:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,开扬声器
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.24,1:24:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.96,1:25:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特 我一直在想你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.80,1:25:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我筹足钱了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.96,1:25:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有钱了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.28,1:25:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺快的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.80,1:25:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.16,1:25:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.12,1:25:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我把钱带去那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.64,1:25:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在市中心的楼里见我
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.12,1:25:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约一小时后见
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.36,1:25:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 一小时
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.68,1:25:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,人渣
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.52,1:25:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说安保情况
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.88,1:25:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼伦科夫 他在他的顶层豪华公寓办公
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.28,1:25:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一个私人电梯和两个保镖
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.64,1:25:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼伦科夫来了 让电梯下去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.48,1:25:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯是由楼上的安保控制的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.28,1:25:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看见电梯里的人 并按下确认键
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.68,1:25:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电梯升上去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.64,1:25:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上的电梯外是安保室
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.80,1:25:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有另外三个保镖
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.96,1:25:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和两重门
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.64,1:25:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过第二重门就是曼伦科夫的私人公寓
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.52,1:26:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你能帮我个忙吗 这个单子只有地址 没有名字
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.84,1:26:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 车后面还有很多易腐食品 - 去一楼问前台 好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.00,1:26:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一楼 非常感谢 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.44,1:26:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.56,1:26:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来见奥列格·曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.24,1:26:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 先生 祝您愉快
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.72,1:26:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.56,1:26:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.80,1:27:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是多兹勒
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.88,1:27:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,接电话 表现得正常点
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.28,1:27:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍小聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.44,1:27:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 圣约翰先生
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.08,1:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是弗兰克·多兹勒
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.40,1:27:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.64,1:27:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在开会呢 有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.32,1:27:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·米尔斯 把你的继女从家里带走了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.64,1:27:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就在你家这里
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.92,1:27:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 那…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.60,1:27:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么时候回家 - 我现在就出发
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.92,1:27:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我这里过去 大概需要一个小时的时间
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.28,1:27:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在在哪 - 我在马利布
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.76,1:27:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我觉得他对她没有恶意 他…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.28,1:27:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣约翰先生 这个人是谋杀你妻子的主要嫌疑人
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.12,1:27:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的同伙在你家门口
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.48,1:27:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着枪指着我的人
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.60,1:27:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 他很危险 而且必须抓住他
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.44,1:27:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你需要 我可以派车去接你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.76,1:27:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你得呆在一个安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.16,1:27:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.64,1:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就出发
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.60,1:28:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会等着你的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.04,1:28:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我定位一下圣约翰的手机
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.64,1:28:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他发现你不在马利布
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.28,1:28:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会马上跑到这里来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.52,1:28:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我说
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.08,1:28:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他出现之前 我们只有不到30分钟的时间行动
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.28,1:28:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点时间对我来说够了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.52,1:28:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 你能操作这个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.80,1:28:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.12,1:28:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有什么事 随时向我报告就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.84,1:28:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.44,1:28:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察 这是你给我们的加油站的监控录像
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.04,1:28:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是截图 一帧一帧的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.32,1:28:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.48,1:28:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于他在哪里 他向你撒谎了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.04,1:28:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真意外 - 他在市区
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.12,1:28:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去抓那家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.32,1:28:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.68,1:28:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他的位置了 我们走 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.68,1:28:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.00,1:28:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 条子们出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.04,1:28:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.72,1:28:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切按计划行事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.64,1:28:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要临场发挥
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.88,1:29:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是耍花招 他们会杀了你的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.04,1:29:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且就算他们不杀 我也会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.72,1:29:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我能说多少次对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.00,1:29:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.28,1:29:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.09,1:29:37.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布莱恩·米尔斯短信下载）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.52,1:29:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是多兹勒
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.68,1:29:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了一些你可能感兴趣的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.32,1:29:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对比了圣约翰和他妻子的保险
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.68,1:29:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人各投了1200万
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.92,1:29:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.56,1:30:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斯图尔特·圣约翰 曼伦科夫先生在等我
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.88,1:30:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个包里有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.32,1:30:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们黑进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.00,1:30:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.00,1:30:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特·圣约翰没问题 把电梯解锁
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.76,1:30:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.68,1:30:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.32,1:30:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.72,1:30:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.76,1:30:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切正常吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.48,1:30:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给控制电梯的打电话
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.84,1:30:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到货车上
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.88,1:31:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.88,1:31:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.80,1:31:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他上来了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.56,1:31:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.80,1:31:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏上演了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.04,1:31:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.80,1:31:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.36,1:31:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.88,1:35:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.12,1:35:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.24,1:35:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这老头子是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.36,1:35:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我的前妻
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.96,1:35:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不会让你杀了我的女儿的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.76,1:36:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.64,1:36:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧槽
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.16,1:36:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被同一个人耍了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.48,1:36:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.16,1:36:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特·圣约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.48,1:36:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他先让我去杀了你的妻子
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.80,1:36:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再来杀你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.40,1:36:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不成功
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.92,1:36:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就让你来杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.72,1:36:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样他都赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.88,1:36:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妻子只是一场交易的一部分 就像很多在我之前的人一样
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.68,1:36:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到我输了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.92,1:36:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.68,1:36:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.16,1:36:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活该
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.08,1:36:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.20,1:36:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是活该
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.80,1:37:11.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我需要和你见面 晚上10点 在兰乔加油站见 我是布莱恩）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.40,1:37:24.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（妈妈被杀那晚 你手机给她发短信 约她在兰乔加油站见面 有人用了你手机）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.40,1:37:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.76,1:37:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.04,1:37:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.60,1:37:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.84,1:37:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.44,1:37:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.60,1:37:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.68,1:37:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.32,1:37:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,进车子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.76,1:37:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.20,1:37:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.44,1:37:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,进车子
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.36,1:38:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 叫个医务人员过来 让他马上就来
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.88,1:38:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.96,1:38:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看电梯
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.68,1:38:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,多兹勒 我是史密斯 我们在曼伦科夫的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.96,1:38:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得米尔斯就在这里 - 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.80,1:38:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我现在就去查一下这幢公寓
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.00,1:38:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.12,1:38:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你还能动吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.28,1:38:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,退几步 退几步
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.52,1:39:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走 所有人都进来
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.00,1:39:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.88,1:39:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很有可能还在这幢楼里
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.64,1:39:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫楼下的人 封锁大楼 谁都不允许进出
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.92,1:39:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁大楼 谁都不允许进出
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.16,1:40:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在妈妈被杀那晚 你的手机给她发短信
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.84,1:40:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,约她在兰乔加油站见面
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.76,1:40:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人用了你的手机
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.78,1:40:27.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（追踪金姆的手机中）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.02,1:40:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里是圣塔莫妮卡航空 - 我是圣约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.68,1:40:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我15分钟之内到 把飞机准备好
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.16,1:40:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.88,1:40:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.72,1:41:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你爸爸和他的朋友都是一群杀人狂
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.84,1:41:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这坨满嘴胡话的屎 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.72,1:41:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你杀了她
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.00,1:41:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.40,1:41:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.00,1:41:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布鲁克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.36,1:41:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你定位一辆黑色的保时捷 车牌号码689MJC6
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.88,1:41:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.00,1:41:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我连上保时捷的车载电话并且定位
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.48,1:41:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.16,1:41:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要搜寻一辆车 加州牌照
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.88,1:41:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,号码689MJC6
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.00,1:41:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要他的电话号码
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.70,1:41:37.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（陌生号码来电）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.04,1:41:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,接电话
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.56,1:41:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色保时捷车载电话已定位
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.04,1:41:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,正向西驶
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.44,1:41:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.48,1:41:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 米尔斯先生
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.76,1:41:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是多兹勒
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.88,1:41:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有点头绪了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.68,1:41:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两份人身安全保险
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.24,1:41:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份是圣约翰的 一份是你前妻的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.08,1:41:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.72,1:42:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特欠这些俄国人钱
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.44,1:42:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,欠了很多
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.56,1:42:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是绑架她的那些人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.72,1:42:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们就把她带到我的家里杀掉
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.12,1:42:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好让我没法妨碍他们
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.96,1:42:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你放手
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.44,1:42:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来处理这件事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.88,1:42:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能处理
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.04,1:42:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说哪件事最重要 督察
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.24,1:42:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕圣约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.52,1:42:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,并以谋杀你前妻的罪名起诉他
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.24,1:42:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 最重要的是我的女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.76,1:42:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.72,1:42:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.96,1:42:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.20,1:42:51.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（金姆手机位置 圣塔莫妮卡机场）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.40,1:42:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们现在就走 快 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.64,1:42:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.68,1:42:59.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣塔莫尼卡公路）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.28,1:43:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑道安全
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.84,1:43:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.28,1:43:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊 快点 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.84,1:43:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求允许起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.96,1:43:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看到那辆保时捷了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.96,1:43:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在前往圣塔莫妮卡机场
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.36,1:43:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有小队到圣塔莫妮卡机场
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.12,1:43:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视一辆黑色的保时捷
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.54,1:43:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,4990航班
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.51,1:43:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑行道已关闭
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.68,1:43:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.24,1:43:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.80,1:44:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 起飞速度不够
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.00,1:44:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.88,1:44:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的把枪给我
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.24,1:44:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的把枪给我
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.72,1:44:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打爆你的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.88,1:44:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.36,1:44:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.24,1:44:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗我去干掉那群俄罗斯人
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.88,1:45:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来喝咖啡
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.24,1:45:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿我的手机 发短信 然后把它们删除
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.16,1:45:09.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我需要和你见面 晚上10点 在兰乔加油站见 我是布莱恩）
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.28,1:45:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你的同伙就可以把丽诺尔的尸体放我家
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.04,1:45:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫁祸我
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.78,1:45:21.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（快来见我 急事 带点甜甜圈）
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.24,1:45:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你的问题就解决了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.92,1:45:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不用担心了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.88,1:45:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是事情不是这么来的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.96,1:45:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.60,1:45:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.56,1:45:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在可杀不了我了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.60,1:45:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.44,1:45:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.28,1:45:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你认识很多人
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.68,1:45:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再找一个好一点的律师 你几年之内就可以出狱了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.80,1:45:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那时我会来找你
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.32,1:46:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到你
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.44,1:46:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道会发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.52,1:46:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一开始就知道
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.52,1:46:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那些甜甜圈
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.08,1:46:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是热的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.04,1:47:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不问自己…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.24,1:47:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么人会出去买几个热乎乎的甜甜圈…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.04,1:47:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,再回来杀人
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.52,1:47:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我比较了那些你从我们电脑上下载的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.24,1:47:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,被删除的短信的时间标签
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.68,1:47:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然这是犯法的 我们可以为了这个逮捕你
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.36,1:47:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以的 但这让我吃了一惊
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.72,1:47:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能把这件事想通了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.04,1:47:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要离开他了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.04,1:47:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要这笔保险赔偿金来偿还曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.72,1:47:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃跑可没给我们帮上什么忙
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.72,1:47:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想通了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.86,1:47:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要得到这笔保险赔偿金 并且摆脱曼伦科夫
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.96,1:47:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的计划就是
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.36,1:47:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去杀了那个会去杀他的人
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.88,1:47:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只有这样才能保证我女儿的安全
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.24,1:47:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差点就得逞了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.20,1:47:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.64,1:47:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 督察 我们谈完了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.24,1:47:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.40,1:48:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈完了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.32,1:48:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈完了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.12,1:48:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 呃 能不能接下来一个月别出城
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.12,1:48:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有可能还有其他的问题要问你
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.12,1:48:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.80,1:48:27.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（犯罪调查）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.93,1:48:37.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布莱恩·米尔斯）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.12,1:48:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们两个…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.60,1:48:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一晚上都在想这件事
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.32,1:48:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个很重要的选择
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.80,1:48:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们怎么决定
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.32,1:49:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个人 一起
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.48,1:49:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都会全力支持你们
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.44,1:49:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你妈妈也会这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.68,1:49:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉他吧 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.80,1:49:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈过很久了
